<h2>Asobi Review 0.2 (build 425)</h2>
<p><b>Notes follow the side you're working on.</b></p>
<ul>
<li>While comparing, a new note lands on the side you're looking at — flip to the B version and your note belongs to it. The amber strip above the composer always names the exact target.</li>
<li>Film Lab's stock lists are grouped by family (for Expert reviewers with the Film Lab).</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
